s Browser-Steuerung","Leistungsüberwachung","Multi-Sitzungs-Unterstützung","MCP-Automatisierungstools","Integration mit WebDriver","Sicherheitsüberprüfung"],"pt":["Controle de navegador de ponta","Monitoramento de desempenho","Suporte a multi-sessão","Ferramentas de automação de navegador de 45+ MCP","Navegação e interação com elementos"],"ru":["Управление браузером высшего класса","Мониторинг производительности","Поддержка нескольких сессий","Инструменты автоматизации браузера из 45+ MCP","Навигация и взаимодействие с элементами"],"ar":["التحكم في المتصفح ذو الأداء العالي","مراقبة الأداء","دعم الجلسات المتعددة","أدوات توتير المتصفح من 45+ MCP","التنقل وتفاعل مع العناصر"]},"keywords":{"zh":["浏览器自动化","rust-browser-mcp","WebDriver","企业级浏览器控制","性能监控","多会话支持"],"ja":["ブラウザ自動化","rust-browser-mcp","WebDriver","企業級ブラウザ制御","パフォーマンス監視","複数セッションサポート"],"ko":["브라우저 자동화","rust-browser-mcp","WebDriver","기업급 브라우저 제어","성능 모니터링","다중 세션 지원"],"es":["automatización de navegador","rust-browser-mcp","WebDriver","control de navegador","monitoreo de rendimiento","seguridad auditada","desarrollo web","pruebas de navegador"],"fr":["automatisation de navigateur","rust-browser-mcp","WebDriver","contrôle de navigateur","surveillance des performances","sécurité auditée","développement web","tests de navigateur"],"de":["Browser-Automatisierung","rust-browser-mcp","WebDriver","Browser-Steuerung","Leistungsüberwachung","Sicherheitsüberprüfung","Webentwicklung","Browertests"],"pt":["automação de navegador","controle de navegador","WebDriver","rust-browser-mcp","desenvolvimento de software","testes de software","ferramentas de automação"],"ru":["автоматизация браузера","управление браузером","WebDriver","rust-browser-mcp","разработка программного обеспечения","тестирование программного обеспечения","инструменты автоматизации"],"ar":["توتير المتصفح","التحكم في المتصفح","بروتوكول WebDriver","خادم rust-browser-mcp","تطوير البرمجيات","اختبار البرمجيات","أدوات التوتير"]}},"owner":"aiskillstore","repo":"marketplace","repoPath":"aiskillstore/marketplace","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-20T04:13:19.574Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"browser-automation","description":"Enterprise-grade browser automation using WebDriver protocol. Use when the user needs to automate web browsers, perform web scraping, test web applications, fill forms, take screenshots, monitor performance, or execute multi-step browser workflows. Supports Chrome, Firefox, and Edge with connection pooling and health management.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Browser Automation Skill\n\nThis skill provides guidance for using the rust-browser-mcp server to automate web browsers through the WebDriver protocol. It enables enterprise-grade browser control with performance monitoring, multi-session support, and health management.\n\n## Overview\n\nThe rust-browser-mcp server provides 45+ MCP tools for browser automation:\n\n### Core Automation Tools (25)\n- **Navigation**: `navigate`, `back`, `forward`, `refresh`\n- **Element Interaction**: `click`, `send_keys`,","body":"# Browser Automation Skill\n\nThis skill provides guidance for using the rust-browser-mcp server to automate web browsers through the WebDriver protocol. It enables enterprise-grade browser control with performance monitoring, multi-session support, and health management.\n\n## Overview\n\nThe rust-browser-mcp server provides 45+ MCP tools for browser automation:\n\n### Core Automation Tools (25)\n- **Navigation**: `navigate`, `back`, `forward`, `refresh`\n- **Element Interaction**: `click`, `send_keys`, `hover`, `find_element`, `find_elements`\n- **Information Extraction**: `get_title`, `get_text`, `get_attribute`, `get_property`, `get_page_source`\n- **Advanced**: `fill_and_submit_form`, `login_form`, `scroll_to_element`, `wait_for_element`\n- **JavaScript**: `execute_script`\n- **Visual**: `screenshot`, `resize_window`, `get_current_url`, `get_page_load_status`\n\n### Performance Monitoring Tools (5)\n- `get_performance_metrics` - Page load times, resource timing, navigation data\n- `monitor_memory_usage` - Heap monitoring, memory leak detection\n- `get_console_logs` - Error detection, log filtering\n- `run_performance_test` - Automated performance analysis\n- `monitor_resource_usage` - Network, FPS, CPU tracking\n\n### Driver Management Tools (7)\n- `start_driver`, `stop_driver`, `stop_all_drivers`\n- `list_managed_drivers`\n- `get_healthy_endpoints`, `refresh_driver_health`\n- `force_cleanup_orphaned_processes`\n\n### Recipe System (4)\n- `create_recipe` - Create reusable automation workflows\n- `execute_recipe` - Run a saved recipe\n- `list_recipes` - List all available recipes\n- `delete_recipe` - Remove a recipe\n\n## Setup Instructions\n\n### Prerequisites\nEnsure you have at least one WebDriver installed:\n- **Chrome**: ChromeDriver (must match Chrome version)\n- **Firefox**: GeckoDriver\n- **Edge**: MSEdgeDriver\n\n### Configuration for Claude Desktop\n\nAdd to your `claude_desktop_config.json`:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"mcpServers\": {\n    \"browser\": {\n      \"command\": \"/path/to/rust-browser-mcp\",\n      \"args\": [\"--transport\", \"stdio\", \"--browser\", \"chrome\"]\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Environment Variables\n\n| Variable | Default | Description |\n|----------|---------|-------------|\n| `WEBDRIVER_ENDPOINT` | `auto` | WebDriver URL or \"auto\" for auto-discovery |\n| `WEBDRIVER_HEADLESS` | `true` | Run browsers in headless mode |\n| `WEBDRIVER_PREFERRED_DRIVER` | - | Preferred browser: chrome, firefox, edge |\n| `WEBDRIVER_CONCURRENT_DRIVERS` | `firefox,chrome` | Browsers to start concurrently |\n| `WEBDRIVER_POOL_ENABLED` | `true` | Enable connection pooling |\n| `WEBDRIVER_POOL_MAX_CONNECTIONS` | `3` | Max connections per driver type |\n\n## Usage Patterns\n\n### Basic Navigation\n```\n1. Use `navigate` with URL to load a page\n2. Use `wait_for_element` to ensure page loads\n3. Use `get_title` or `get_text` to verify content\n```\n\n### Form Filling\n```\n1. Navigate to the form page\n2. Use `find_element` with CSS selector to locate fields\n3. Use `send_keys` to input values\n4. Use `click` on submit button, or use `fill_and_submit_form` for convenience\n```\n\n### Web Scraping\n```\n1. Navigate to target page\n2. Use `find_elements` to get multiple matching elements\n3. Use `get_text` or `get_attribute` to extract data\n4. Use `execute_script` for complex DOM traversal\n```\n\n### Performance Testing\n```\n1. Navigate to page under test\n2. Use `run_performance_test` for automated analysis\n3. Use `get_performance_metrics` for detailed timing data\n4. Use `monitor_memory_usage` to detect leaks\n5. Use `get_console_logs` to capture errors\n```\n\n### Multi-Step Workflows with Recipes\n```\n1. Define a recipe with `create_recipe` including steps array\n2. Each step specifies: action (tool name), arguments, optional retry logic\n3. Execute with `execute_recipe` and parameters\n4. Recipes support conditions and browser-specific variants\n```\n\n## Session Management\n\n### Browser-Specific Sessions\nUse session IDs prefixed with browser name for explicit browser control:\n- `chrome_session1` - Uses Chrome\n- `firefox_work` - Uses Firefox\n- `edge_testing` - Uses Edge\n\n### Multi-Session Support\nYou can run multiple browser sessions concurrently by using different session IDs:\n```\nSession: chrome_user1 -> Opens first Chrome tab\nSession: chrome_user2 -> Opens second Chrome tab\nSession: firefox_admin -> Opens Firefox for different workflow\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n### Error Handling\n1. Always use `wait_for_element` before interacting with dynamic content\n2. Check `get_page_load_status` for slow-loading pages\n3. Use `get_console_logs` to debug JavaScript errors\n\n### Performance\n1. Enable connection pooling (default) for better resource usage\n2. Reuse session IDs when possible\n3. Use headless mode for faster execution\n\n### Security\n1. Never store credentials in recipes\n2. Use environment variables for sensitive data\n3. Clear sessions after authentication workflows\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n### Driver Not Starting\n- Verify WebDriver is installed and in PATH\n- Check browser version matches driver version\n- Use `list_managed_drivers` to see status\n\n### Element Not Found\n- Use browser DevTools to verify selector\n- Wait for page load with `wait_for_element`\n- Try different selector strategies (CSS, XPath)\n\n### Performance Issues\n- Check `monitor_memory_usage` for leaks\n- Use `get_console_logs` for JavaScript errors\n- Consider reducing concurrent sessions\n\n## Reference Files\n\nSee companion files for detailed information:\n- `reference/tools.md` - Complete tool documentation\n- `reference/recipes.md` - Recipe system guide\n- `examples/` - Example automation scripts\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-20T04:35:03.112Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Automation Agents requiring enterprise-grade browser control through the WebDriver protocol.","zh":"适用于需要通过WebDriver协议进行企业级浏览器控制的自动化代理。","ja":"WebDriverプロトコルを介したエンタープライズグレードのブラウザ制御を必要とする自動化エージェントに適しています。","ko":"WebDriver 프로토콜을 통한企业급 브라우저 제어가 필요한 자동화 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Automatización que requieren control de navegador de nivel empresarial a través del protocolo WebDriver.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''automatisation nécessitant un contrôle de navigateur de niveau entreprise via le protocole WebDriver.","de":"Ideal für Automatisierungsagenten, die eine unternehmensweite Browsersteuerung über das WebDriver-Protokoll benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Automação que exigem controle de navegador de classe empresarial por meio do protocolo WebDriver.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов автоматизации, требующих корпоративного класса управления браузером через протокол WebDriver.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التأشير الذي يحتاج إلى التحكم في متصفح الويب من الدرجة التجارية من خلال بروتوكول WebDriver."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate web browsers with performance monitoring, multi-session support, and health management using the rust-browser-mcp server and its 45+ MCP tools, including core automation tools like navigation and element interaction.","zh":"赋予代理自动化Web浏览器的能力，包括性能监控、多会话支持和健康管理，使用rust-browser-mcp服务器及其45+个MCP工具，包括导航和元素交互等核心自动化工具。","ja":"rust-browser-mcpサーバーとその45以上のMCPツールを使用して、パフォーマンス監視、複数セッションのサポート、ヘルス管理を実現し、ナビゲーションや要素の相互作用などのコア自動化ツールを提供します。","ko":"rust-browser-mcp 서버와其 45개 이상의 MCP 툴을 사용하여 성능 모니터링, 다중 세션 지원, 헬스 관리 등을实现하며, 네비게이션 및 요소 상호작용 등의 핵심 자동화 도구를 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar los navegadores web con monitoreo de rendimiento, soporte de varias sesiones y administración de salud utilizando el servidor rust-browser-mcp y sus 45+ herramientas MCP, incluidas herramientas de automatización básicas como navegación e interacción de elementos.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser les navigateurs web avec un suivi des performances, un support de plusieurs sessions et une gestion de la santé en utilisant le serveur rust-browser-mcp et ses 45+ outils MCP, notamment des outils d''automatisation de base tels que la navigation et l''interaction avec les éléments.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Webbrowser mit Leistungsüberwachung, Unterstützung für mehrere Sitzungen und Gesundheitsmanagement zu automatisieren, indem der rust-browser-mcp-Server und seine 45+ MCP-Tools verwendet werden, einschließlich Kern-Automatisierungstools wie Navigation und Elementinteraktion.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar os navegadores da web com monitoramento de desempenho, suporte a multi-sessão e gerenciamento de saúde usando o servidor rust-browser-mcp e suas 45+ ferramentas MCP, incluindo ferramentas de automação de core como navegação e interação de elementos.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать веб-браузеры с помощью мониторинга производительности, поддержки многосессионности и управления здоровьем с использованием сервера rust-browser-mcp и более 45 инструментов MCP, включая базовые инструменты автоматизации, такие как навигация и взаимодействие с элементами.","ar":"يمنح الوكيل القدرة على تحسين متصفحات الويب مع مراقبة الأداء ودعم الجلسة المتعددة وإدارة الصحة باستخدام خادم rust-browser-mcp وأدواته MCP البالغ عددها 45+ ، بما في ذلك أدوات الأتمتة الأساسية مثل التنقل وتفاعل العناصر."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating web application testing with navigation and element interaction tools","Generating performance reports through multi-session support and health management","Debugging web browser issues with core automation tools like click and send_keys"],"zh":["使用导航和元素交互工具自动化Web应用程序测试","通过多会话支持和健康管理生成性能报告","使用点击和send_keys等核心自动化工具调试Web浏览器问题"],"ja":["ナビゲーションや要素の相互作用などのツールを使用してWebアプリケーションのテストを自動化する","複数セッションのサポートとヘルス管理を使用してパフォーマンスレポートを生成する","クリックやsend_keysなどのコア自動化ツールを使用してWebブラウザの問題をデバッグする"],"ko":["네비게이션 및 요소 상호작용 등의 툴을 사용하여 웹 애플리케이션 테스트를 자동화하는 것","다중 세션 지원 및 헬스 관리를 사용하여 성능 보고서를 생성하는 것","클릭이나 send_keys 등의 핵심 자동화 툴을 사용하여 웹 브라우저의 문제를 디버깅하는 것"],"es":["Automatización de pruebas de aplicaciones web con herramientas de navegación y interacción de elementos","Generación de informes de rendimiento a través del soporte de varias sesiones y la administración de la salud","Depuración de problemas del navegador web con herramientas de automatización básicas como hacer clic y enviar claves"],"fr":["Automatisation des tests d''applications web avec des outils de navigation et d''interaction avec les éléments","Génération de rapports de performance via le support de plusieurs sessions et la gestion de la santé","Débogage des problèmes de navigateur web avec des outils d''automatisation de base tels que le clic et l''envoi de clés"],"de":["Automatisierung von Webanwendungstests mit Navigationstools und Elementinteraktionstools","Erstellung von Leistungsberichten durch Unterstützung von mehreren Sitzungen und Gesundheitsmanagement","Fehlerbehebung bei Webbrowser-Problemen mit grundlegenden Automatisierungstools wie Klicken und Tastenübermittlung"],"pt":["Automatizar testes de aplicativos da web com ferramentas de navegação e interação de elementos","Gerar relatórios de desempenho por meio do suporte a multi-sessão e gerenciamento de saúde","Depurar problemas do navegador da web com ferramentas de automação de core como clique e envio de teclas"],"ru":["Автоматизировать тестирование веб-приложений с помощью инструментов навигации и взаимодействия с элементами","Генерировать отчеты о производительности с помощью поддержки многосессионности и управления здоровьем","Отладить проблемы веб-браузера с помощью базовых инструментов автоматизации, таких как клик и отправка клавиш"],"ar":["أتمتة اختبارات تطبيقات الويب باستخدام أدوات التنقل وتفاعل العناصر","إنتاج تقارير الأداء من خلال دعم الجلسة المتعددة وإدارة الصحة","إصلاح مشاكل متصفح الويب باستخدام أدوات الأتمتة الأساسية مثل النقر وإرسال المفاتيح"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires rust-browser-mcp server setup","WebDriver protocol compatibility needed","Limited to enterprise-grade browser control"],"zh":["需要rust-browser-mcp服务器设置","需要WebDriver协议兼容性","仅限企业级浏览器控制"],"ja":["rust-browser-mcpサーバーのセットアップが必要","WebDriverプロトコルの互換性が必要","エンタープライズグレードのブラウザ制御のみ"],"ko":["rust-browser-mcp 서버 설정이 필요","WebDriver 프로토콜 호환성이 필요","企業급 브라우저 제어만 가능"],"es":["Requiere configuración del servidor rust-browser-mcp","Se necesita compatibilidad con el protocolo WebDriver","Limitado al control de navegador de nivel empresarial"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration du serveur rust-browser-mcp","Une compatibilité avec le protocole WebDriver est nécessaire","Limité au contrôle de navigateur de niveau entreprise"],"de":["Benötigt die Einrichtung des rust-browser-mcp-Servers","WebDriver-Protokoll-Kompatibilität erforderlich","Begrenzt auf die unternehmensweite Browsersteuerung"],"pt":["Exige configuração do servidor rust-browser-mcp","Compatibilidade com o protocolo WebDriver necessária","Limitado ao controle de navegador de classe empresarial"],"ru":["Требует настройки сервера rust-browser-mcp","Необходима совместимость с протоколом WebDriver","Ограничен управлением браузером корпоративного класса"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد خادم rust-browser-mcp","تحتاج إلى توافق مع بروتوكول WebDriver","محدود بالتحكم في متصفح الويب من الدرجة التجارية"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"5ab1360fa14dc6e15d845533cbd57f80fc68a2bb4f2b6e54892da88e4e952993","qualityScore":85}');
