INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('affaan-m/everything-claude-code/python-testing', 'python-testing', 'affaan-m', 'everything-claude-code', 'official', 'python-testing affaan-m everything-claude-code official ai-agents anthropic claude claude-code developer-tools llm mcp productivity The python-testing skill provides comprehensive testing strategies for Python applications using pytest, TDD methodology, and best practices, benefiting developers and AI agents alike. Python pytest测试框架的完整TDD开发指南，涵盖fixtures依赖注入、mock对象技术、参数化测试用例设计和覆盖率报告生成。 Python pytestテストフレームワークによる包括的なTDD開発手法、fixturesによる依存性注入、mockオブジェクト技術、パラメータ化テストケース設計とカバレッジレポート生成。 Python pytest 테스트 프레임워크를 이용한 종합적인 TDD 개발 방법론, fixtures를 통한 의존성 주입, mock 객체 기술, 매개변수화 테스트 케이스 설계 및 커버리지 리포트 생성。 Pruebas de Python con pytest, TDD y mejores prácticas para desarrolladores Tests Python avec pytest, TDD et meilleures pratiques pour les développeurs Python-Tests mit pytest, TDD und Best Practices für Entwickler Desenvolva testes em Python com pytest, TDD e boas práticas para garantir a qualidade do seu código Разрабатывайте тесты для Python с помощью pytest, TDD и лучших практик для обеспечения качества вашего кода قُم بتطوير الاختبارات ببايثون باستخدام pytest و TDD وأفضل الممارسات لضمان جودة كودك how to use python-testing python-testing setup guide pytest tutorial for python-testing TDD methodology in python-testing python-testing vs unittest python-testing install for AI agents improving test coverage with python-testing python-testing best practices for developers pytest测试框架 TDD开发方法 Python单元测试 fixtures依赖注入 mock测试技术 参数化测试用例 测试覆盖率要求 red-green-refactor Implements Test-Driven Development (TDD) cycle with RED, GREEN, and refactor stages Utilizes pytest for efficient testing Supports fixtures, mocking, and parametrization for robust test suites Enforces coverage requirements for thorough testing Facilitates setting up testing infrastructure for Python projects python-testing is a set of testing strategies for Python applications using pytest, TDD methodology, fixtures, mocking, parametrization, and coverage requirements.');
